<title>SPAIN: Spain's Agroman has Q1 profit after loss.</title>
<headline>Spain's Agroman has Q1 profit after loss.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction group Agroman said on Wednesday that it had a first quarter net profit of 218 million pesetas.</p>
<p>Agroman had a 606 million peseta loss in the same period last year, while the firm ended 1996 with a net profit of 40 million pesetas.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of 1997, net turnover was 20.89 billion pesetas, 12.7 percent higher than the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
